      "message": "Looks like you figured this out? Per https://go.dev/wiki/GerritBot#how-does-gerritbot-determine-the-final-commit-message, GerritBot uses the raw contents of the initial PR message.\n\n(This seems like a pain point in the GerritBot PR integration)",
